### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### OpenConnect — Demo API Requests
### Install: REST Client (humao.rest-client) → click "Send Request"
###
### Servers:
###   Mock API   → npm run test-api    (port 3010)
###   Backend    → npm run server      (port 3002)
###
### Test accounts:
###   1234567890  → MUHAMMAD AHMED KHAN  (balance: 150,250.75)
###   9876543210  → FATIMA ZAHRA SHEIKH  (balance: 85,430.00)
###   1111111111  → UNEEB AHMED
###   0000000000  → triggers "Account not found"
###   bankCode 999 → triggers "Bank unreachable"
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl     = http://localhost:3010
@backendUrl  = http://localhost:3002
@contentType = application/json


# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HEALTH CHECK
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [1] Mock API Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

###


# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEMO URL 1 — Account Balance Inquiry
# POST http://localhost:3010/api/v1/account/balance-inquiry
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [2] Balance Inquiry — Happy Path (account found, full response)
# Expected: responseCode=000, accountTitle=MUHAMMAD AHMED KHAN, balance=150,250.75
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/account/balance-inquiry
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "channelId": "MOBILE_APP",
  "requestId": "TF20260423001",
  "traceId": "TRACE20260423001",
  "transactionDateTime": "2026-04-23T10:00:00.000Z",
  "bankCode": "01",
  "accountNumber": "1234567890",
  "iban": "",
  "rrn": "202604230001",
  "stan": "100001"
}

###

### [3] Balance Inquiry — Account Not Found
# Expected: responseCode=001, "Account not found"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/account/balance-inquiry
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "channelId": "MOBILE_APP",
  "requestId": "TF20260423002",
  "traceId": "TRACE20260423002",
  "transactionDateTime": "2026-04-23T10:01:00.000Z",
  "bankCode": "01",
  "accountNumber": "0000000000",
  "iban": "",
  "rrn": "202604230002",
  "stan": "100002"
}

###

### [4] Balance Inquiry — Bank Unreachable
# Expected: responseCode=002, "Bank not reachable"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/account/balance-inquiry
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "channelId": "MOBILE_APP",
  "requestId": "TF20260423003",
  "traceId": "TRACE20260423003",
  "transactionDateTime": "2026-04-23T10:02:00.000Z",
  "bankCode": "999",
  "accountNumber": "1234567890",
  "iban": "",
  "rrn": "202604230003",
  "stan": "100003"
}

###


