# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BACKEND — OpenConnect API Layer (config must be in DB first)
# POST http://localhost:3002/api/layer/invoke/:configId
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [20] List All Configured Services (from DB)
GET {{backendUrl}}/api/layer/configs

###

### [21] Backend Health Check
GET {{backendUrl}}/api/health

###

### [22] API Layer Invoke — Balance Inquiry via OpenConnect
# Replace :1 with the actual configId from [20] above
# OpenConnect reads the DB config, builds the request, and proxies to mock API
POST {{backendUrl}}/api/layer/invoke/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "channelId": "MOBILE_APP",
  "requestId": "TF20260423050",
  "traceId": "TRACE20260423050",
  "transactionDateTime": "2026-04-23T10:50:00.000Z",
  "bankCode": "01",
  "accountNumber": "1234567890",
  "iban": "",
  "rrn": "202604230050",
  "stan": "100050"
}

